note gate-pools 8 (recorded): touch 128 MiB of a pool, one byte per page. Under
note systemd-run --user --scope -p MemoryMax=64M the expected result is the kernel's OOM kill (137).
global U uchar *
fn main to int
r = enlarge U ulong 134217728
if ne r 0
ret 3
end
i = ulong 0
while lt i 134217728 bound 40000
put U i 1
i = add i 4096
end
ret 0
end
